    "LIMITATION": "Distances here are alignment-free proxies. The ICTV species criterion for Hantaviridae is DEmARC with a pairwise evolutionary distance cutoff of 0.1 under the WAG model, which requires multiple sequence alignment and maximum-likelihood inference. Columns are named kmer_* and never ped_* for this reason. Any published claim about a specific reassortant needs confirmation with a real alignment and phylogeny (e.g. MAFFT + IQ-TREE).",
